{"meta":{"id":"tt24326458","type":"movie","name":"One Mile: Chapter One","imdb_id":"tt24326458","description":"Un ex agente de las fuerzas especiales intenta reencontrarse con su hija adolescente durante un viaje universitario por carretera. Cuando un desvío inesperado les pone en el punto de mira de una comunidad secreta y aislada, su hija es secuestrada y el viaje se convierte en una lucha de alto octanaje por la supervivencia. Solo y en inferioridad numérica, se ve obligado a utilizar todas sus habilidades para seguirles la pista, desmantelarlos y traer a su hija a casa.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt24326458.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xBORKTaQJTq3l7EdnTTnrZnYzYa.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/IyZu8ZEdmmXZtPAzcK8UKQrhVG.png","genres":["Acción","Crimen"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-02-20T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"90 min","imdbRating":"5.7","country":"United States of America, Canada","cast":["Ryan Phillippe","Amélie Hoeferle","Sara Canning","Sage Linder","Beverley Elliott","Phil Burke","Gabrielle Jacinto","C. Thomas Howell","Richard Harmon","Michael Eklund","Aodhan Guy","Jimmy Clarke","Andre Tricoteux","Jason Beaudoin","Harper Grace Maybin","Jayden Popik","Anthony Timpano","James Michalopolous","Hugo Raymundo","April Telek"],"director":["Adam Davidson"],"writer":["John Hlavin","Rasheed Newson","T.J. Brady"],"trailers":[{"source":"868HlmpAhtQ","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"868HlmpAhtQ","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"868HlmpAhtQ","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"5.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt24326458"},{"name":"Acción","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Acci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Crimen","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?g